# New Session Handover

Create a comprehensive handover package for continuing work in a fresh session without losing any context, research, or findings.

## Process

1. **Create detailed session log** — Write comprehensive markdown document to `~/.claude/workspaces/spacedog/handover/sessions/[tag]-YYYY-MM-DD-HHMM-[slug].md` with ALL session details
2. **Update handover entry** — Append/update entry in `~/.claude/workspaces/spacedog/handover/handover.md` (same as `/handover` command)
3. **Generate continuation prompt** — Create ready-to-paste prompt with vault reading instructions and critical context
4. **Report** — Show continuation prompt and confirm files written

## Session Log Location

```
~/.claude/workspaces/spacedog/handover/sessions/[tag]-YYYY-MM-DD-HHMM-[slug].md
```

Session logs are synced via GitHub (part of claude-config repo) and available across all machines.

